# Debugging

On bug / fail / "doesn't work":
1. Reproduce. Can't → report and stop.
2. Read full error + stack.
3. One hypothesis in writing.
4. Evidence before any code change.
5. Fix root; grep callers.
6. Regression test when logic broke; re-run original repro.

Forbidden: change "to see"; silence with catch/sleep/retry;
fix two hypotheses at once. After 3 misses: STUCK report + ask.
